# Art

**Under the Canopy** is a readable stylized 3D RTS (stylized realism / isometric diorama). Reference: AoE4. Chunky silhouettes, slightly toy proportions, painted-but-PBR materials, warm directional light, real shadows. Not photoreal, not cartoon, not low-poly.

One iso plane. Forest is atmosphere (trees as objects), not layered sim.

**Destination:** real meshes (glTF) + PBR (`MeshStandardMaterial`) + a sun + real shadows. Iterate assets in the world editor (`tooling/`).

Canon: [`docs/game/art.md`](docs/game/art.md). Editor: [`docs/build-plan/editor.md`](docs/build-plan/editor.md).
